00:01:37.680 --> 00:01:39.930
I think it caught a lot of people's truth,

00:01:39.930 --> 00:01:42.670
which is, in general, what
I think my content does.

00:01:42.670 --> 00:01:45.260
I think the setting was very raw and real.

00:01:45.260 --> 00:01:46.900
I mean this is now,
Drock, we're getting old,

00:01:46.900 --> 00:01:48.940
this is six years ago.

00:01:48.940 --> 00:01:50.959
