00:01:50.959 --> 00:01:53.510
- [Drock] On Facebook.
- On Facebook.

00:01:53.510 --> 00:01:54.550
It was just raw.

00:01:54.550 --> 00:01:55.450
It was super real.

00:01:55.450 --> 00:01:57.060
