00:02:23.458 --> 00:02:24.390
- [Drock] All right, ready?

00:02:24.390 --> 00:02:26.140
- So it's early Monday morning,

00:02:26.140 --> 00:02:29.060
and I've been wanting to
make a Monday morning video

00:02:29.060 --> 00:02:31.560
for a long time, and finally,
Drock, we're doing it.

00:02:31.560 --> 00:02:32.700
So, real quick--

00:02:32.700 --> 00:02:33.533
Stop right there.

00:02:33.533 --> 00:02:35.250
A couple weeks ago, I wrote a blog post

00:02:35.250 --> 00:02:36.740
