00:02:36.740 --> 00:02:37.573
(bell dinging)

00:02:37.573 --> 00:02:38.970
I'm always smoking, I'm always smoking.

00:02:38.970 --> 00:02:40.890
So clearly, what happened in that weekend

00:02:40.890 --> 00:02:43.700
was I read enough Dms or emails

00:02:43.700 --> 00:02:47.800
