00:02:50.510 --> 00:02:53.910
is like, this has been
on my mind, and it has.

00:02:53.910 --> 00:02:56.340
People hating Monday is
something I've really been

00:02:56.340 --> 00:02:58.290
in tune with, because I hated Monday

00:02:58.290 --> 00:03:01.983
from 1982 to 1998, 'cause I hated school.

00:03:03.792 --> 00:03:04.625
- [Drock] Okay, go ahead.

00:03:04.625 --> 00:03:07.470
- This is just a rant, very simple

00:03:07.470 --> 00:03:09.290
and something that I want you to pass on

00:03:09.290 --> 00:03:11.420
or watch every Monday morning,

00:03:11.420 --> 00:03:14.470
because the level of
complaining is unacceptable.

00:03:14.470 --> 00:03:16.710
Look, what if I told you

00:03:16.710 --> 00:03:18.360
this was the last Monday
morning of your life?

00:03:18.360 --> 00:03:19.193
Right.

00:03:19.193 --> 00:03:20.590
What if I told you you died this week?

00:03:20.590 --> 00:03:22.710
Would you complain about your crap job?

00:03:22.710 --> 00:03:23.543
Think about that.

00:03:23.543 --> 00:03:25.734
Today, I was with a guy for 15 minutes

00:03:25.734 --> 00:03:27.970
who's working with the Sasha Group,

00:03:27.970 --> 00:03:30.230
and he talked about always
hearing me about this,

00:03:30.230 --> 00:03:33.830
always resonated, and then
his son had a brain tumor.

00:03:33.830 --> 00:03:35.800
And he was going so hard,
all these businesses,

00:03:35.800 --> 00:03:38.050
and he was like, "Who gives a shit!"

00:03:38.050 --> 00:03:39.290
I was like, "Yeah."

00:03:39.290 --> 00:03:40.980
And, people need to know that.

00:03:40.980 --> 00:03:42.640
People are complaining right now

00:03:42.640 --> 00:03:47.640
