00:03:53.930 --> 00:03:58.930
But fucking dwelling and
devastated and life is ruined

00:03:59.030 --> 00:04:01.570
when there's so much pain in the world

00:04:01.570 --> 00:04:03.240
around people who have
really lost loved ones

00:04:03.240 --> 00:04:06.560
