about the world that way.

00:04:16.220 --> 00:04:19.290
And I think living that
way while being patient,

00:04:19.290 --> 00:04:21.244
it's that friction of
the opposite opinion.

00:04:21.244 --> 00:04:23.940
Live like it's your last day on Earth

00:04:23.940 --> 00:04:26.340
